editor_description = "Keeps established palm feet while replacing generated rods and sphere tops with directly editable sources. Arrival palms select the very dense 30–32-frond classic-California pinnate crown; road and Boardwalk palms keep the lighter 12–14-frond form. Arrival and front-road beds retain the shared Hakone and Purple Heart ring layer."

